---
// The dashboard moved to "/"; this page only keeps old bookmarks working with a permanent redirect and an empty
// body. `return Astro.redirect("/", 301)` would do, but a frontmatter `return` crashes
// @typescript-eslint/no-misused-promises in .astro files (see src/pages/dev/account-states.astro).
Astro.response.status = 301;
Astro.response.headers.set("Location", "/");
---
